WEBVTT

00:00:05.437 --> 00:00:08.338
The Irresponsible Captain
Tylor

00:00:09.041 --> 00:00:11.911
We may be off the maps...
Chizu ni Nai Tabi Tsuzukeyou

00:00:11.911 --> 00:00:13.970
...but let's stay on this voyage.
Chizu ni Nai Tabi Tsuzukeyou

00:00:14.813 --> 00:00:18.943
I will be holding, never let you go.

00:00:20.519 --> 00:00:23.355
Whatever we may want...
Hoshimono wa Tsukamu no sa

00:00:23.355 --> 00:00:25.482
...we'll take as we need.
Hoshimono wa Tsukamu no sa

00:00:26.258 --> 00:00:30.285
So let's just go wherever we please!
Omoi no Mama Yukou!

00:00:31.997 --> 00:00:34.767
Make me your partner...
Kotoba yori Tashikana Koto

00:00:34.767 --> 00:00:37.395
...on this journey.
Kotoba yori Tashikana Koto

00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:41.265
One that you trust more than words!
Michizure ni Shite

00:00:42.708 --> 00:00:47.372
Come on now and sail away for future!
Imasugu sail away for future

00:00:48.380 --> 00:00:49.882
Things are waiting...
Mishiranu Nanika ga Matteru sa

00:00:49.882 --> 00:00:53.079
...that we've never seen before!
Mishiranu Nanika ga Matteru sa

00:00:54.920 --> 00:00:57.089
Just take your cares...
Kodawari Minna Sutetara

00:00:57.089 --> 00:01:01.150
...and throw them all away.
Kodawari Minna Sutetara

00:01:01.393 --> 00:01:06.023
Come together, just think of tomorrow.

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:09.290
Let's go!

00:01:12.504 --> 00:01:15.940
STRANGE LOVE

00:01:49.341 --> 00:01:51.901
We are inside of
our flagship, the Melva.

00:01:52.311 --> 00:01:54.302
Do you understand what
that means, Captain Tylor?

00:01:54.647 --> 00:01:58.606
Sure. Outside is just space, so I
shouldn't run away or cause trouble.

00:01:58.984 --> 00:02:01.885
Guess I'll be relaxing
here till the war's over.

00:02:02.054 --> 00:02:05.956
The Raalgon Empire doesn't
keep its prisoners alive.

00:02:06.191 --> 00:02:07.249
Did you know that?

00:02:07.359 --> 00:02:09.793
Yeah, I know. Harumi told me.

00:02:11.397 --> 00:02:14.059
You let yourself be captured
knowing you'd probably be killed?

00:02:14.466 --> 00:02:15.524
Are you a fool?

00:02:15.934 --> 00:02:19.972
If a smart captain like Dom
just wanted to kill me...

00:02:19.972 --> 00:02:23.776
...he'd have done it already.
He wouldn't have captured me.

00:02:23.776 --> 00:02:27.143
Too much trouble.
Even a fool can see that!

00:02:44.463 --> 00:02:47.899
This is the man who
destroyed Donan's fleet?!

00:02:48.233 --> 00:02:50.793
Yes, sir. The captain of
the destroyer Soyokaze.

00:02:50.903 --> 00:02:53.030
Lt. Cmdr. Justy Ueki Tylor.

00:02:53.372 --> 00:02:56.500
I don't believe it!
He's hardly more than a boy!

00:02:56.909 --> 00:02:59.139
He doesn't look like
captain material to me.

00:02:59.545 --> 00:03:02.446
For some reason, that's what
everyone seems to say.

00:03:02.715 --> 00:03:04.205
Forgive me, Your Excellency.

00:03:04.583 --> 00:03:07.211
Don't be fooled by
Tylor's outward appearance.

00:03:07.586 --> 00:03:10.612
Beneath it lies a tactical
genius full of great plans.

00:03:10.856 --> 00:03:13.290
A tactical genius
full of great plans?!

00:03:13.592 --> 00:03:16.459
For some reason,
I have a knack for winning.

00:03:16.595 --> 00:03:20.031
I see. Then I'd better
be on my guard, hadn't I?

00:03:40.185 --> 00:03:41.482
Food!

00:03:46.625 --> 00:03:48.559
You should at least feed me.

00:03:49.628 --> 00:03:50.617
Just great...

00:04:39.878 --> 00:04:43.245
If anyone learned the empress
sneaks midnight snacks...

00:04:43.315 --> 00:04:44.612
...I'd never live it down!

00:04:45.250 --> 00:04:48.344
But I can't stand
feeling so hungry!

00:04:48.854 --> 00:04:50.788
Fortunately, there's only
that one chef in here.

00:04:53.692 --> 00:04:55.284
Very well, in that case...

00:05:29.595 --> 00:05:33.463
There's plenty here. You should've
just said you were hungry!

00:05:33.866 --> 00:05:37.267
No... No one must learn of this!
Is that clear?!

00:05:37.736 --> 00:05:41.228
Yeah, sure. You know,
you talk sort of funny.

00:05:42.374 --> 00:05:44.137
Do you always talk like that?

00:05:44.910 --> 00:05:47.679
Could it be he
doesn't recognize me?

00:05:47.679 --> 00:05:48.873
Oh, guess it doesn't matter.

00:05:49.414 --> 00:05:52.542
Very well. If he doesn't
recognize me, then all the better.

00:05:52.951 --> 00:05:55.920
Huh? Aren't you gonna eat?
You're hungry, aren't you?

00:06:03.362 --> 00:06:07.890
Delicious! You deserve to be
a chef here on the Melva.

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:11.663
Glad to hear it, but everything
tastes good when you're hungry.

00:06:15.374 --> 00:06:17.399
Another bowl, please,
my dear chef!

00:06:24.449 --> 00:06:25.916
Show you around the ship?!

00:06:25.984 --> 00:06:26.473
Right.

00:06:26.785 --> 00:06:28.844
This ship's more like a planet.

00:06:29.221 --> 00:06:30.245
Don't you know about it?

00:06:30.522 --> 00:06:31.750
No. Show it to me.

00:06:36.795 --> 00:06:38.194
What's in here?

00:06:38.430 --> 00:06:40.990
He doesn't
recognize any of this.

00:06:41.400 --> 00:06:44.267
He must have just come
aboard the ship today.

00:07:13.165 --> 00:07:15.827
This place is huge,
but there's nothing in here.

00:07:16.668 --> 00:07:18.499
This is the soldiers'
recreation room.

00:07:27.179 --> 00:07:29.113
This is the first time
I've ever entered it.

00:08:17.496 --> 00:08:20.056
Wow... What's going on?

00:08:20.465 --> 00:08:21.557
This... This is!

00:08:29.875 --> 00:08:32.139
This is my home!

00:08:32.544 --> 00:08:34.444
Oh? Your home?

00:08:34.780 --> 00:08:37.476
Oh, yeah. I forgot to ask.
What's your name?

00:08:38.583 --> 00:08:39.277
Azalyn.

00:08:39.818 --> 00:08:42.218
So, Azalyn,
this is your home, huh?

00:09:30.368 --> 00:09:32.632
Wow, you can even
touch the stuff in here.

00:11:00.058 --> 00:11:01.821
These clean your palate
after a meal.

00:11:12.404 --> 00:11:13.371
Peco-Peco!

00:11:14.739 --> 00:11:16.707
He was once my pet!

00:11:17.075 --> 00:11:18.201
Your pet?

00:11:18.710 --> 00:11:21.110
Come along, now.
It's me, Azalyn.

00:11:24.416 --> 00:11:26.611
It's me! Have you forgotten?

00:11:29.054 --> 00:11:29.748
Peco-Peco!

00:11:30.422 --> 00:11:31.753
You won't get away!

00:11:32.757 --> 00:11:34.224
Come back here, Peco-Peco!

00:11:35.093 --> 00:11:36.526
Peco-Peco, huh?

00:11:36.661 --> 00:11:37.593
There he goes!

00:11:40.799 --> 00:11:42.790
That's it! Get him, Chef!

00:11:46.438 --> 00:11:48.201
What are you waiting for?
He'll get away!

00:11:48.773 --> 00:11:49.569
Right!

00:11:51.443 --> 00:11:52.637
Chef, please!

00:12:01.786 --> 00:12:02.844
How dare you!

00:12:05.757 --> 00:12:07.588
Uh-oh, he got away again.

00:12:10.128 --> 00:12:12.892
Leave this to me!
I'll get him back!

00:12:13.798 --> 00:12:16.528
Hey! Come back here,
Peco-Peco!

00:12:16.801 --> 00:12:19.429
Hold it! Hey! Come on!

00:12:19.504 --> 00:12:21.233
Okay, now I've got you!

00:12:27.746 --> 00:12:28.610
Chef!

00:12:32.484 --> 00:12:33.974
It's a bottomless swamp!

00:12:34.819 --> 00:12:35.945
I'm sinking!

00:12:37.122 --> 00:12:38.214
Chef!

00:12:39.124 --> 00:12:40.284
It's no use!

00:12:41.159 --> 00:12:42.524
Chef!

00:12:43.061 --> 00:12:44.688
Save me!

00:12:52.504 --> 00:12:54.836
CHEF!

00:13:04.249 --> 00:13:07.150
What do you know...
I can stand.

00:13:08.186 --> 00:13:09.175
Chef...

00:13:11.156 --> 00:13:12.384
Isn't that wonderful,
Peco-Peco?

00:13:26.538 --> 00:13:28.802
Wow, it even rains in here.

00:13:30.875 --> 00:13:32.342
Oh, that's right!

00:13:33.345 --> 00:13:35.176
You have a cottage, Azalyn?

00:13:35.447 --> 00:13:39.042
Up ahead. We can get out
of the rain. Want to see?

00:13:39.217 --> 00:13:40.275
I dunno...

00:13:40.685 --> 00:13:42.152
What's wrong, Chef?

00:13:42.554 --> 00:13:43.919
A cottage, huh?

00:13:44.422 --> 00:13:45.480
You don't like cottages?

00:13:46.458 --> 00:13:47.025
No, it's not that...

00:13:47.025 --> 00:13:48.126
Why is it? I don't understand.
No, it's not that...

00:13:48.126 --> 00:13:50.890
Why is it? I don't understand.
Then you don't like me?

00:13:51.229 --> 00:13:53.288
Why is it? I don't understand.

00:13:53.732 --> 00:13:56.001
Why does my heart pound so...

00:13:56.001 --> 00:13:57.035
Why does my heart pound so...
Don't be silly!

00:13:57.035 --> 00:13:57.836
Why does my heart pound so...

00:13:57.836 --> 00:13:59.531
...on this night I'm alone?

00:13:59.804 --> 00:14:00.638
Why is it? Please tell me why.
Let's go!

00:14:00.638 --> 00:14:06.344
Why is it? Please tell me why.

00:14:06.344 --> 00:14:12.840
You, with your strange smile,
my strange lover.

00:14:16.521 --> 00:14:21.458
I sit here, counting
the stars in the sky.

00:14:21.893 --> 00:14:27.957
Waiting for you to come to me.

00:14:29.534 --> 00:14:34.528
These feelings that seem
to have no place inside me...

00:14:34.939 --> 00:14:37.942
I don't dare tell
anyone about them.

00:14:37.942 --> 00:14:40.968
It would just
be too much to bear.

00:14:41.546 --> 00:14:45.950
Oh, how I wish that you
could find the door...

00:14:45.950 --> 00:14:49.317
...to my heart
and gently open it.

00:14:49.387 --> 00:14:52.123
Even when I sound selfish...

00:14:52.123 --> 00:14:59.552
...I'm really lonely and
want to try to be sweet.

00:14:59.898 --> 00:15:06.428
In the moonlight, dancing,
dancing alone.

00:15:06.905 --> 00:15:12.944
My shadow seeming to
reach out to you.

00:15:12.944 --> 00:15:19.484
All alone, dancing,
not able to sleep.

00:15:19.484 --> 00:15:22.654
Because of you,
the one who thrills me.

00:15:22.654 --> 00:15:23.388
My strange lover.

00:15:23.388 --> 00:15:25.223
My strange lover.
Made it. But the rain's stopped.

00:15:25.223 --> 00:15:26.281
Made it. But the rain's stopped.

00:15:39.104 --> 00:15:40.594
That's quite a cottage.

00:15:41.506 --> 00:15:42.632
Come on, let's go in.

00:16:00.024 --> 00:16:01.457
F- Father!

00:16:05.463 --> 00:16:06.191
Azalyn.

00:16:19.344 --> 00:16:20.174
Azalyn.

00:16:22.380 --> 00:16:25.008
What's wrong? Come to me.

00:16:27.385 --> 00:16:29.319
Come, Azalyn.

00:16:30.188 --> 00:16:33.555
No... No, I...

00:16:36.728 --> 00:16:39.288
l... I mean...

00:16:39.964 --> 00:16:40.658
Azalyn.

00:16:42.700 --> 00:16:43.826
No...

00:17:45.029 --> 00:17:45.893
Um...

00:17:51.069 --> 00:17:53.060
Um, hello?

00:18:12.023 --> 00:18:14.692
Come on...
Let's take it easy!

00:18:14.692 --> 00:18:17.991
There's lots of bad stuff in life,
but there's lots of good stuff, too!

00:18:21.099 --> 00:18:21.997
You look funny!

00:18:25.169 --> 00:18:28.366
There. Young girls look
best when they're laughing.

00:18:28.740 --> 00:18:30.071
Young girls?

00:18:33.511 --> 00:18:34.136
Dom?

00:18:40.518 --> 00:18:42.418
Everyone has been worried.

00:18:50.161 --> 00:18:50.889
Very well!

00:18:51.863 --> 00:18:53.854
You dropped this.

00:19:01.072 --> 00:19:02.471
I wish this man to have it.

00:19:19.223 --> 00:19:23.626
Well, it's time for us to
go back as well, my dear chef.

00:19:29.567 --> 00:19:30.261
Here!

00:19:48.753 --> 00:19:51.688
This man Tylor
appears to be a fool...

00:19:51.756 --> 00:19:56.819
...but he was clever enough to
destroy the glorious Donan fleet!

00:19:57.195 --> 00:19:59.857
Were we to execute this
man as an example...

00:19:59.931 --> 00:20:04.425
...we would be sure to raise
the morale of the Raalgon Empire!

00:20:18.216 --> 00:20:20.878
You... You're Tylor?

00:20:21.886 --> 00:20:22.580
Yeah...

00:20:23.621 --> 00:20:27.751
Captain of the United Planets
Space Force destroyer Soyokaze.

00:20:27.959 --> 00:20:31.087
Lt. Cmdr. Justy Ueki Tylor,
age twenty, Your Highness!

00:20:34.132 --> 00:20:36.760
Highness! Prisoners must die!

00:20:37.301 --> 00:20:41.635
That is the unshakable law
of the Holy Raalgon Empire!

00:20:52.316 --> 00:20:55.046
Wang... This man
is not to be killed!

00:20:55.653 --> 00:20:58.281
Yes, High...
What did you say?!

00:20:58.756 --> 00:21:01.418
Not kill him?!
What's going on?!

00:21:02.660 --> 00:21:05.925
He will not be killed.
I shall make a pet of him!

00:21:06.764 --> 00:21:10.666
He shall serve as an example to the
lowly United Planets Space Force!

00:21:11.169 --> 00:21:12.033
An example?

00:21:12.203 --> 00:21:13.397
But, Highness...

00:21:14.672 --> 00:21:17.368
Silence, Wang!
The decision has been made!

00:21:18.009 --> 00:21:19.943
I hereby name
this man Paco-Paco!

00:21:20.278 --> 00:21:23.008
He is to be treated
as my royal pet!

00:21:23.681 --> 00:21:25.706
As... As you wish!

00:21:44.335 --> 00:21:47.600
Give him the finest
treatment we can.

00:21:47.839 --> 00:21:52.538
The treatment appropriate
for Her Highness' new pet!

00:22:12.430 --> 00:22:13.454
The Irresponsible Captain Tylor
Next Episode

00:22:14.732 --> 00:22:16.400
No matter how bad their
relationship may be...

00:22:16.400 --> 00:22:19.003
...people come together when
they share a common goal.

00:22:19.003 --> 00:22:21.472
Oh, yes! Especially when
that goal is a jailbreak!

00:22:21.472 --> 00:22:23.441
Next time, "The Unjust Desert."

00:22:23.441 --> 00:22:24.305
Watch for it.

00:22:25.343 --> 00:22:27.208
Filming is Job 1!
Working hard for those who demand
the finest in image and sound

00:22:38.322 --> 00:22:41.425
All he has to do is just...
Machi o Aitsu ga Aruiteru dake de

00:22:41.425 --> 00:22:44.519
...walk around downtown.
Machi o Aitsu ga Aruiteru dake de

00:22:45.029 --> 00:22:48.499
He's a playful man who catches...
Nandemo Ki o Hiku Ochame na Yatsu sa

00:22:48.499 --> 00:22:51.332
...the eyes of all who he meets.
Nandemo Ki o Hiku Ochame na Yatsu sa

00:22:51.836 --> 00:22:54.672
Oh! That's why, you see...
Aa, Dakara sa Sou Kore kara Shuyaku

00:22:54.672 --> 00:22:58.472
...he'll be our hero from now on.
Aa, Dakara sa Sou Kore kara Shuyaku

00:22:59.277 --> 00:23:01.646
So, let's begin...
Henshin Byouyomi o Shite yo!

00:23:01.646 --> 00:23:05.480
...the countdown for the change!
Henshin Byouyomi o Shite yo!

00:23:08.953 --> 00:23:11.751
Take a deep breath, and one two.
12345 Ikizugi o One Two

00:23:12.890 --> 00:23:15.226
Now stride out...
Saa Kore kara Kuridasou

00:23:15.226 --> 00:23:18.389
...with your head held high.
Saa Kore kara Kuridasou

00:23:18.529 --> 00:23:22.260
Downtown Dance
